{"3664580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Valiance", "steam_appid": 3664580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Valiance</strong></i> is a fast-paced FPS that combines abilities from Hero Shooters like Overwatch or Paladins with fast paced gameplay elements from Boomer Shooters like Ultrakill or Doom Eternal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/e9cf130317dc498a4eab8cca55972093.poster.avif?t=1777214747\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/e9cf130317dc498a4eab8cca55972093.webm?t=1777214747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/e9cf130317dc498a4eab8cca55972093.mp4?t=1777214747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Create your own character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Valiance you can create your own character and decide your own playstyle. Choose from a variety of weapons and abilities and create a character you love or a craft a new one fit for your current challenge.<br><br>You can create a character to suit your playstyle preferences or theory craft to create the strongest character to beat whatever fight you are at.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/2ced18fad5e4ff188f32cb730d6e8258.poster.avif?t=1777214747\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/2ced18fad5e4ff188f32cb730d6e8258.webm?t=1777214747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/2ced18fad5e4ff188f32cb730d6e8258.mp4?t=1777214747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Fast paced Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valiance features challenging fast paced FPS gameplay similar to what you´ll find in games like Doom Eternal, Paladins, Overwatch or Ultrakill. Chain together ability combos, dodge enemy projectiles and slice through your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/459e180bdbceeed690008cd3866a3fc5.poster.avif?t=1777214747\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/459e180bdbceeed690008cd3866a3fc5.webm?t=1777214747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/459e180bdbceeed690008cd3866a3fc5.mp4?t=1777214747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Valiance</strong></i> is a fast-paced FPS that combines abilities from Hero Shooters like Overwatch or Paladins with fast paced gameplay elements from Boomer Shooters like Ultrakill or Doom Eternal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/e9cf130317dc498a4eab8cca55972093.poster.avif?t=1777214747\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/e9cf130317dc498a4eab8cca55972093.webm?t=1777214747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/e9cf130317dc498a4eab8cca55972093.mp4?t=1777214747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Create your own character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Valiance you can create your own character and decide your own playstyle. Choose from a variety of weapons and abilities and create a character you love or a craft a new one fit for your current challenge.<br><br>You can create a character to suit your playstyle preferences or theory craft to create the strongest character to beat whatever fight you are at.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/2ced18fad5e4ff188f32cb730d6e8258.poster.avif?t=1777214747\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/2ced18fad5e4ff188f32cb730d6e8258.webm?t=1777214747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/2ced18fad5e4ff188f32cb730d6e8258.mp4?t=1777214747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Fast paced Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valiance features challenging fast paced FPS gameplay similar to what you´ll find in games like Doom Eternal, Paladins, Overwatch or Ultrakill. Chain together ability combos, dodge enemy projectiles and slice through your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/459e180bdbceeed690008cd3866a3fc5.poster.avif?t=1777214747\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/459e180bdbceeed690008cd3866a3fc5.webm?t=1777214747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/459e180bdbceeed690008cd3866a3fc5.mp4?t=1777214747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>", "short_description": "A fast paced FPS where you create your own character by choosing from your arsenal of abilities and weapons. Craft your build and chain together devastating ability &amp; weapon combos to rip apart hordes of ravenous monsters to protect your people.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/00ae990f67c3f27ff0662cbd135e5b0cb277224a/header.jpg?t=1777214747", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/07bd86fd17180f4b63ac7d6568401f4e6eeb4304/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777214747", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/07bd86fd17180f4b63ac7d6568401f4e6eeb4304/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777214747", "website": "https://www.mairagames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> 64-bit Windows 7 / 64-Bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 @ 3.3 GHz or better, or AMD Ryzen 3 @ 3.1 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050Ti (4GB), GTX 1060 (3GB), GTX 1650 (4GB) or AMD Radeon R9 280(3GB), AMD Radeon R9 290 (4GB), RX 470 (4GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 13 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i7-6700K or better, or AMD Ryzen 7 1800X or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (6GB), NVIDIA GeForce 970 (4GB), AMD RX 480 (8GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Maira Games"], "publishers": ["Maira Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"wi